OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies petrol bombing homes
OL,4,
OL,5,FA man accused of throwing suspected
OL,6,Fpetrol bombs at homes has pleaded not
OL,7,Fguilty to all charges against him.
OL,9,FMalcolm Dennis Greening, of La Route
OL,10,Fdes Cornus in St Martin, Guernsey,
OL,11,Fappeared at the Royal Court earlier,
OL,12,Fcharged with three counts of arson and
OL,13,Fone count of perverting the course of
OL,14,Fjustice.
OL,16,FThe 69-year-old pleaded not guilty to
OL,17,Fall four charges during a plea and
OL,18,Fdirections hearing before Judge
OL,19,FCatherine Fooks.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
