OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies petrol bombing homes
OL,4,
OL,5,FIt follows police investigations into
OL,6,Fsuspected incendiary objects being
OL,7,Fthrown at properties in St Martin on 8
OL,8,FFebruary and 30 September last year.
